So the new v1.2 does not immediately apply to PDF 2.0. If you see this as an issue, could you please raise a separate errata here in GitHub?

A few general comments:
* the PDF spec needs to define how all previous versions of PDF also worked as files written against those exist in the wild, so we cannot remove this (maybe de-emphasise aspects is OK);
* the PDF spec purposely tries to avoid prescribing a single implementation;
* just because a vendor decides to take one approach in their specific implementation doesn't mean everyone else has to follow - so long as all implementations generate valid PDFs they can do what they wish;
* many implementations silently recover malformed PDFs, but this is currently out of scope for the PDF spec (and there are a LOT of malformed cross-reference tables out there!).

